<title>ITALY: No problems with Pope's operation - Italian agencies.</title>
<headline>No problems with Pope's operation - Italian agencies.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pope John Paul's operation to remove his appendix on Tuesday was completed without problems, Italian news agencies reported.</p>
<p>The ANSA agency, quoting hospital sources, said surgery was &quot;conducted without complications&quot;. AGI agency carried a similar report. Neither could immediately be confirmed.</p>
</text>
